OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F401A1786027701
OL,3,CMan charged with murder after fatal
OL,4,Cshooting
OL,6,FA man has been charged with murder
OL,7,Ffollowing a fatal shooting in
OL,8,FWiltshire.
OL,10,FWiltshire Police said Shane Porter,
OL,11,F35, has been charged with the murder
OL,12,Fof Jimmy Ward, 36, who died at the
OL,13,Fscene in Calcutt, near Cricklade, on
OL,14,FSunday.
OL,16,FPorter, of Calcutt Park, has also been
OL,17,Fcharged with possession of a shotgun
OL,18,Fwithout a certificate.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/4
