OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F401A1786027701
OL,3,CMan charged with murder after fatal
OL,4,Cshooting
OL,6,FHe has been remanded into custody and
OL,7,Fis due to appear via video link at
OL,8,FSwindon Magistrates' Court tomorrow
OL,9,F(Thursday 6 August).
OL,11,FThe force said Eddie Porter, 74, and
OL,12,FTammy Brown, 42, both of Luton, have
OL,13,Fboth been charged with assisting an
OL,14,Foffender and possession of a shotgun
OL,15,Fwithout a certificate.
OL,17,FThey have also been remanded into
OL,18,Fcustody and are due to appear via
OL,19,Fvideo link at the same court tomorrow.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/4
