OL,3,CMan charged with murder after fatal
OL,4,Cshooting
OL,6,FSubscribe free to our weekly
OL,7,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,8,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,9,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,11,FTwo other men arrested on suspicion of
OL,12,Fassisting an offender have been
OL,13,Freleased on bail.
OL,15,FDetective Chief Inspector Phil Walker,
OL,16,Ffrom Wiltshire Police's Major Crime
OL,17,FInvestigation Team, said: "My thoughts
OL,18,Fcontinue to be with Jimmy's next of
OL,19,Fkin at this difficult time.
