OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F401A1786027701
OL,3,CMan charged with murder after fatal
OL,4,Cshooting
OL,6,F"A scene and increased policing
OL,7,Fpresence will remain at the site in
OL,8,Fthe coming days while further activity
OL,9,Fis carried out.
OL,11,F"I'd like to express again my thanks
OL,12,Fto the local community for their
OL,13,Fpatience and support since Sunday.
OL,15,F"I appreciate the significant concern
OL,16,Fthis incident has generated, so please
OL,17,Fconsider speaking with officers about
OL,18,Fany information or concerns you may
OL,19,Fhave."
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G4/4
